        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alamgir, Meesha Shafi, Strings, Ali Azmat, Shahzad Hasan, Umair Jaswal, Hina Khawaja Bayat, Sania Saeed, Fiza Ali\n- Products: Music Icons, Aaina, Mor Mahal\n- Organizations: ARY Digital\n- Topics: Pakistani music, television, film\n\nFacts:\n- In 1976, Alamgir produced the album Aaina from the soundtrack of the Urdu-language Pakistani film of the same name.\n- Ali Azmat was born on April 20, 1970, and he is a Pakistani singer-songwriter, musician, and actor.\n- In April 2013, Alamgir joined Meesha Shafi, Strings, Ali Azmat, and Shahzad Hasan as a judge on the singing talent show Music Icons.\n- Music Icons aired on the ARY Digital TV channel.\n- The serial Mor Mahal stars Umair Jaswal, Meesha Shafi, Hina Khawaja Bayat, Sania Saeed, and Fiza Ali in lead roles.",
